<title>PHILIPPINES: PLDT to have 1.53 mln lines by year-end.</title>
<headline>PLDT to have 1.53 mln lines by year-end.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co said it will have over one million lines by year-end as committed under its Zero Backlog Program.</p>
<p>PLDT executive vice-president Jose de Jesus in a letter to Communications Minister Amado Lagdameo, a copy of which was given to Reuters, said by November, PLDT will be able to install its one millionth line.</p>
<p>By year-end, the carrier will have 1.53 million lines in service, he said.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418936 fax 8176267</p>
